---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Forced Labour Policy | Eurocert Asia"
  description="Read Eurocert Asia forced labour policy and commitments supporting ethical employment, human rights and responsible business practices."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/forced-labour-policy/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368109/eurocert/k0.png.png" alt="Forced Labour Policy" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/70 to-[#030a16]/40"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-24"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 backdrop-blur-sm mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Our Commitment</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Forced Labour <span class="text-eurogold-400">Policy</span></h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/80 text-sm heading-font mt-4"><a class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors" href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="text-white/70">Forced Labour Policy</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Policy Statement</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Identifying &amp; Removing <span class="text-euro-600">Risk</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We are committed to identifying and removing sources of risk of FORCED LABOUR in our organization and in our supply chain.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[300px] md:h-[360px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368116/eurocert/k1.png.png" alt="Identifying &amp; Removing Risk of Forced Labour" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"/></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 h-[300px] md:h-[360px] group order-2 lg:order-1"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368121/eurocert/k2.png.png" alt="Travel &amp; Rest Policy" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"/></div><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6 order-1 lg:order-2"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Auditor Welfare</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Travel &amp; <span class="text-eurogold-400">Rest Policy</span></h2></div><p class="text-white/50 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The travelling time of auditors although not strictly work time but affects their overall discretionary time. Our Travel and Rest policy will take care of this explicitly.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Ethical Recruitment</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">No Fee <span class="text-euro-600">Recruitment</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We are committed to using only those recruitment agencies in our recruitment who do not charge fees from the candidate.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[300px] md:h-[360px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368125/eurocert/k3.png.png" alt="No Fee Recruitment" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"/></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 h-[300px] md:h-[360px] group order-2 lg:order-1"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368130/eurocert/k4.png.png" alt="Ethical Service Partners" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"/></div><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6 order-1 lg:order-2"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Service Providers</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Ethical <span class="text-eurogold-400">Service Partners</span></h2></div><p class="text-white/50 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We are also committed not to using any service provider who withholds money or is not dedicated to the restricted use of voluntary overtime.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Impartiality</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">No Conflict of <span class="text-euro-600">Interest</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We do NOT engage with our clients directly or indirectly on the implementation of this policy to avoid conflict of interest.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[300px] md:h-[360px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368134/eurocert/k5.png.png" alt="No Conflict of Interest" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"/></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">At A Glance</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Our Commitments</h2></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identifying and removing sources of risk of FORCED LABOUR in our organization and in our supply chain.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">The travelling time of auditors although not strictly work time but affects their overall discretionary time. Our Travel and Rest policy will take care of this explicitly.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Using only those recruitment agencies in our recruitment who do not charge fees from the candidate.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Not using any service provider who withholds money or is not dedicated to the restricted use of voluntary overtime.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">We do NOT engage with our clients directly or indirectly on the implementation of this policy to avoid conflict of interest.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Have <span class="text-euro-600">Questions?</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">If you have concerns or want to report a forced labour issue, please contact us immediately.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white bg-euro-600 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-euro-700 transition-all shadow-lg" href="/contact/">Chat With Us <i class="fas fa-comments text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
